## Login feature

this file defines the login feature

Users will be able to login
it should require email and password
all fields are required
the layout is located at [login.png](mdc:layout-images/login.png)
it should post all data
the api endponint is '/auth/login'
after login the user should see a toast with the server message
user token should be saved in the localstorage
[api-client.ts](mdc:src/lib/api-client.ts) should use the token saved
if request fails or there any missing info user should see a red toast
after success user should be redirect to the 'saving-jars' page
